From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:00:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Official collector: retry broken downloads up to 4 times
 (site v253)

Owner 2026-11-05 21:54 approved. The 11/05 morning run lost the TWSE
issuer roster to two truncated downloads (http.client.IncompleteRead), so
the roster and market snapshots were skipped. The vendored collector now
retries a broken transfer (IncompleteRead or connection reset) up to four
times with 5/10/20 s waits; timeouts and HTTP errors keep two immediate
attempts so a blocked source does not stall the run. FRED still alternates
Python's default and the named User-Agent. Unit tests cover all three
paths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
